@startuml editarPerfil-diseño
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Editar Perfil

actor "Coordinador" as Coordinador
participant "Navegador\n(Thymeleaf)" as View
participant "EditarPerfilController\n(@Controller)" as Controller
participant "PerfilService\n(@Service)" as Service
participant "InvestigadorRepository\n(JpaRepository)" as Repo
database "Base de Datos\n(H2)" as DB

== Cargar formulario ==

Coordinador -> View: Click en "Editar perfil"
activate View
View -> Controller: GET /perfil/editar
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: obtenerPerfil()
activate Service
Service -> Repo: findByUsuario(usuarioActual)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM investigadores WHERE usuario_id = ?
activate DB
DB --> Repo: Investigador
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: Optional<Investigador>
deactivate Repo
Service --> Controller: Investigador
deactivate Service
Controller --> View: editar-perfil.html + Investigador (pre-rellenado)
deactivate Controller
View --> Coordinador: Muestra formulario con datos actuales
deactivate View

== Guardar cambios ==

Coordinador -> View: Modifica datos y pulsa "Guardar"
activate View
View -> Controller: POST /perfil (Investigador modificado)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: guardarPerfil(datos)
activate Service
Service -> Repo: save(investigador)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: UPDATE investigadores SET ... WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB --> Repo: Investigador actualizado
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: Investigador
deactivate Repo
Service --> Controller: Investigador
deactivate Service
Controller --> View: redirect: GET /perfil
deactivate Controller
View --> Coordinador: Muestra perfil actualizado
deactivate View

@enduml
